 Game Night is getting smoother with our latest set of improvements.\n\nBug Fixes and Improvements:\n> Improved hand tracking quality\n> Disconnected players don't hang onto the hat & color\n> Added status ring to ready button\n> Bunny slows down when becoming icy\n> Fixed bunny facing wrong direction occasionally\n> Fixed player token getting stuck in the air\n> Fixed very rare instance of flying boat\n> Fixed fight game arena alignment after player disconnects\n> Improved fight game player position placement\n> Fixed network connectivity when player set time manually on the device\n> Fixed various spectator issues\n> Fixed various disconnect/reconnect issues\n> Performance improvements", "created_date": 1776927433, "id": "26552745317667372", "version": "0.5.21", "version_code": 161, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}